,"heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7566901,"initDialog":756690101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1005],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75669/Q7566901","priority":5,"questId":75669,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":756690101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3888278762,"text":"#{NICKNAME}, over here! Paimon's got something nice to show you!","nextNodeIds":[756690102]},{"nodeId":756690102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":89775722,"text":"Lookie look! Paimon took these pictures on our travels.","nextNodeIds":[756690103]},{"nodeId":756690103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2440866570,"text":"We've been to all sorts of places, and while you were busy exploring, Paimon was busy with her Kamera!","nextNodeIds":[756690104]},{"nodeId":756690104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4191304842,"text":"Here, take a look at these photos Paimon masterfully took.","nextNodeIds":[756690105]},{"nodeId":756690105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2550038002,"text":"By the way, do you remember the two photo albums we bought at Damoville Purveyor?","nextNodeIds":[756690106,756690108]},{"nodeId":756690106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3801133018,"text":"I do.","nextNodeIds":[756690107]},{"nodeId":756690107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1420284570,"text":"Of course you do! Paimon spent all her savings to reserve those albums, even though it was way in advance.","nextNodeIds":[756690111]},{"nodeId":756690111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1718141314,"text":"Anywho, you took one of the albums, and Paimon took the other. That way, we'd match!","nextNodeIds":[756690112]},{"nodeId":756690112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1380172866,"text":"Paimon's already stuffed her album full of photos, but she's not sure if you've done the same yet.","nextNodeIds":[756690113]},{"nodeId":756690113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":956808202,"text":"But just in case, Paimon bought a new photo album, and although she was planning on keeping it as a backup, she'll give it to you if yours is full!","nextNodeIds":[756690114,756690117]},{"nodeId":756690114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3856125954,"text":"Do you like taking pictures, Paimon?","nextNodeIds":[756690115]},{"nodeId":756690115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1710496722,"text":"Yeah! We've been to lots of places together, and seen so many pretty sights that ordinary folks might never even dream of!","nextNodeIds":[756690116]},{"nodeId":756690116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":74817898,"text":"It'd be a shame if Paimon didn't keep some mementos!","nextNodeIds":[756690121]},{"nodeId":756690121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1643782738,"text":"More importantly! These are important memories for both of us!","nextNodeIds":[756690122]},{"nodeId":756690122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1423740002,"text":"We've gotta cherish our past memories and our future experiences. That's what Pacal told Paimon. Wise words, dontcha think?","nextNodeIds":[756690123]},{"nodeId":756690123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1126641098,"text":"Paimon's gonna lend you her Kamera this time so you can take more pictures yourself.","nextNodeIds":[756690124]},{"nodeId":756690124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3146835258,"text":"We're about to journey to Snezhnaya, and Paimon has a feeling that things aren't going to be easy from here on out.","nextNodeIds":[756690125]},{"nodeId":756690125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3600299354,"text":"So let's sort out all the experiences from our journey while we still can!","nextNodeIds":[756690126]},{"nodeId":756690126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2460637674,"text":"That way, no matter what troubles we run into in Snezhnaya, so long as we think of the moments we shared together, we're sure to be brave and keep moving forward!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":756690117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2965533578,"text":"Classic Paimon. Always thinking about others.","nextNodeIds":[756690118]},{"nodeId":756690118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4229614106,"text":"Hehe, well, Paimon is Teyvat's best tour guide, she can't just think of herself!","nextNodeIds":[756690119]},{"nodeId":756690119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1535631826,"text":"Paimon bought an extra photo album because she really loves taking pictures!","nextNodeIds":[756690120]},{"nodeId":756690120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":943277370,"text":"We've seen so many awesome sights during our travels, it'd be a shame if Paimon didn't keep some mementos!","nextNodeIds":[756690121]},{"nodeId":756690108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2467203610,"text":"I don't.","nextNodeIds":[756690109]},{"nodeId":756690109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":786376210,"text":"Eh, you don't? Paimon spent all her savings to reserve those albums, even though it was way in advance.","nextNodeIds":[756690110]},{"nodeId":756690110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3846705626,"text":"But it's fine! You're super busy all the time, so Paimon doesn't mind being a super tolerant travel companion!","nextNodeIds":[756690111]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7566901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_12625:-1876.556,59.205,8977.040,0.000,118.934,0.000]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7566901],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","count":22},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":4}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[175669],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":1947385454,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75669/Q7566901","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[]